description=Glow sticks, chem lights, road flares and a flare gun for Build 42. Crack one and it burns for hours, cannot be put out, and keeps burning wherever you drop or throw it. Vanilla puts a lamp out before it lands; these do not. Throw one down a dark corridor, leave one at a doorway you mean to come back to, or fire a flare over the treeline. Every burn time, light radius, throw range and noise level is a sandbox option.
